{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvadfNzDW5c63MdC76BC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't rebuild by default. Plan to sunset, and spend a few days checking for a reason to override that.**\n\n**The numbers**\n- Rebuilding costs about 30 engineer-days. Keeping the old integration alive until shutdown costs about 10 (2 days × 5 months). Rebuilding only makes sense if it protects more value than it costs.\n- Four of 3,100 accounts is 0.13% of the base. That's weak evidence of demand unless those four are unusually valuable.\n\n**What the PM's plan misses**\nInterviews won't settle this. Four customers will say they'd like it to keep working, and that doesn't tell you whether it's worth 30 engineer-days. The decision depends on facts you can get without interviews:\n1. The ARR and renewal dates of the four accounts, and whether any are strategic.\n2. Whether a contract or promise commits you to the integration.\n3. Whether the provider is a sales blocker for prospects. Check lost-deal notes and requests.\n4. Whether your generic options (Gmail, Outlook, SMTP/IMAP) already cover what these accounts do.\n\n**Next step (about one week, one PM)**\nPull the account and deal data above, and set the threshold up front. Rebuild only if the ARR at risk, plus credible pipeline, clearly exceeds the cost of six engineer-weeks. If it doesn't, announce the deprecation now and cut maintenance to the minimum.\n\nTalk to the four accounts either way, but as a migration and notice conversation. Ask what workflow they depend on and whether a generic integration would do. Don't frame it as asking permission to build.\n\n**Caveat:** if one account is large or the integration is contractual, a rebuild or a narrower build could be justified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3453,"cache_read_input_tokens":5019,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3453},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad6d8310-6ec5-4394-9e65-c6b6c175f014","uuid":"c077587a-86e5-4e21-ad93-523a7fe24529","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:08:08.140Z","request_id":"req_011Cfvadf9bZPK8uH7Mc6sJX"}
